'''Kilo''' was a {{Common}} [[Natural]]-type [[Blox Fruits|Blox Fruit]] that costed {{Money|5,000}} or {{Robux|50}} from the [[Blox Fruit Dealer]]. It is currently an admin/mod-exclusive Blox Fruit.

A physical Kilo fruit could be purchased from [[Dog House (Wenlock)|Wenlock]] at the cost of {{Robux|97}}. This option is still available, but instead of Kilo being available, it is now [[Rocket]]. [[Dog House (Wenlock)|Wenlock's]] dialogue convinces the player to buy it to use for a [[Microchip|Raid microchip]], though it is not recommended.

Currently, Kilo can be obtained via admin [[commands]].

